# The build context is this whole directory now (the API image builds the web
# app in a stage of its own), so what must NOT travel to the daemon is spelled
# out here. Without it every build ships node_modules and a 13 MB installer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
server/releases
server/backups
.git
*.log
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/venv
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/local-data
**/backups
02_PRIVATE_DATA_DO_NOT_PUBLISH
etl-output
